    "text": "The hybridisation of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Fe</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>[</mo><mi>Fe</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>CN</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>]</mo></math> is"
